summary=[('PHASE',status['PHASE']),('FINAL VERDICT',status['FINAL_VERDICT']),('historical freeze integrity','590/590 historical and221/221 Phase1R byte-level SHA256/size PASS'),('AlphaGenome access','USER_ACTION_REQUIRED_ALPHA_TERMS;user confirms not accepted'),('AlphaGenome version/weights','Official repositorycommit '+ag['official_source_commit']+';weights/version/hash NA:no initialization'),('AlphaGenome technical probe','Five fixed loci;10pairednative contexts and40homology blocks sequence QA PASS;0inference;technicalgate HOLD'),('Borzoi reproducibility','PASS:sameofficialf0model0;prior real REF/ALT rerun hashes preserved and reverified'),('GNRS eligible Class B N','33 unchanged primaryloci;59eligible transcriptrows;eligibility is allele/gene orientation,not all statistically significant'),('external QTL resource','Lin etal.2026 medRxivv1;MAGE731;3776reportedSV-eQTLloci;actualsummarynotrecovered'),('external exact-match N','UNDETERMINED:matching not run without allele-linked QTL table;not zero biological overlap'),('external direction-eligible N','UNDETERMINED;0verified usable pairs;not EXTERNAL_QTL_LOW_POWER from a completed match'),('BRFG secondary status','Secondary representation validation;102 source-genotype-supported loci/225donor-locus presencecalls remain candidatejoins;not a hard gate'),('conventional regulatory sanity benchmark',f'MPRA measured resource prepared:{mp["QC_SNV_rows"]}QCGRCh38SNVrows;{mp["paired_LDLR_QC_SNVs"]}pairedLDLRmeasurements;{mp["matched_pairs"]}matchedstrong/weak pairs;modelbenchmark NOT_RUN'),('sentinel N','0'),('unbiased core N','0'),('truth-panel N','0;33truth candidates prepared;not a frozen sentinel panel'),('AlphaGenome formal usable N','0'),('Borzoi formal usable N','0;technical legacy pair not formal'),('GNRS AlphaGenome concordance','NA:not run'),('GNRS Borzoi concordance','NA:not run'),('GNRS rho','NA:not run'),('external AlphaGenome concordance','NA:not run'),('external Borzoi concordance','NA:not run'),('external rho','NA:not run'),('cross-model rho','NA:not run'),('cross-model sign concordance','NA:not run'),('repeat-rich performance','NA:not run'),('long-insertion performance','NA:not run'),('adjusted prediction effect','NA:not run'),('null comparison','NA:NULL1–NULL5 planned;not run'),('Nature Genetics path','NG_PATH_CONDITIONAL:dualindependentvalidation,pairedcalibration,adjusted/broad-domain/trait evidence unestablished;missingATACalone is notNO_GO'),('recommended next phase','Continue Phase1R2 after human terms acceptance/lawfulAlphaGenomeaccess;recovereffect-linkedSVQTLsummaryanddisjoint-donor evidence;rerun S1–S5;noPhase2')]
lines=['# OFFREF-REG Phase1R2 final report','','Audit date:2026-10-10. This preparation run follows the prospectively frozen amendment. Formal calibration has not started.','','| # | Item | Result |','|---|---|---|']+[f'| {i} | {k} | {v} |' for i,(k,v) in enumerate(summary,1)]
lines+=['','## Decision and prepared evidence','','The run remains MULTIMODEL_CALIBRATION_HOLD because human-dependent AlphaGenome access and inference are unavailable. BRFG was downgraded prospectively to secondary representation validation and no longer blocks computational GO. No evidence from formal calibration exists to support a biological NO-GO.','', '| Gate | Status | Evidence |','|---|---|---|']+[f'| {r["gate"]} | {r["status"]} | {r["evidence"]} |' for r in gates]
lines+=['','The amendment resolves the supplied S5/S1–S4 wording conservatively: the external audit must be completed before freeze, while external match N need not be known to freeze the unbiased core. S1 remains HOLD, so the guarded sampling script creates no sentinel. Formal figures R2-1 through R2-10 were not generated because the request permits them only after formal prediction.','', 'GNRS locus-level association selection uses beta_P, permutation_P and nominal_P, followed by deterministic gene/transcript tie-breaking. The 33 identities and 59 eligible transcript records are unchanged. Only '+str(annotation.get('source_nominal_P_lt_005','NA'))+' selected associations have nominal P<0.05, and '+str(annotation.get('source_betaP_lt_005','NA'))+' have source beta_P<0.05. These counts are source-association diagnostics, not FDR-qualified independent validation counts. All 33 remain in the prescribed primary denominator; weaker associations must not be silently removed after prediction.','', 'Native GRCh38 gene exons are prepared using GENCODEv20 and a stable ENSG crosswalk from the preserved source-v19 gene identities. '+str(annotation.get('PASS_loci','NA'))+' loci have verified same-chromosome single-strand exon unions; '+str(annotation.get('UNVERIFIED_loci','NA'))+' require further gene-coordinate resolution. Orientation eligibility does not guarantee gene coverage in a model window. The older UCSC GENCODEv19 coordinate table is hg19 and is excluded from GRCh38 scoring.','', 'The external [2026 SV resource](https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.64898/2026.08.21.26361050v1.full) reports molecular associations in MAGE. The [author repository](https://github.com/jiadong324/1KG_LongRead_SV) and [Zenodo record](https://zenodo.org/records/22000872) expose variant-resource files, but no allele-linked SV-eQTL table was recovered. The callset access probe and supplement retrieval failures are archived; publication counts do not imply a local truth set. Exact overlap and orientation N are UNDETERMINED. No proximity match is promoted to an exact insertion match.','', 'Exact sample identifiers in the GNRS author analysis VCF (451 donors) and MAGE author metadata (731 donors/779 libraries) overlap in93 donors. The actual SV-QTL analysis subset needs confirmation; an independent publication or new RNA library does not make shared people independent. A nonoverlapping-donor summary or recomputation is required for a fully independent cohort claim. The [MAGE official README](https://github.com/mccoy-lab/MAGE) also reports the HG00237/NA11919 sample swap and states that its Zenodo data had not been updated. These samples require corrected input provenance before use.','', 'The [Kircher etal.2019 MPRA resource](https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-019-11526-w) provides measured conventional variant effects. All QC GRCh38 SNV observations are retained. The prospective primary diagnostic subset is the LDLR HepG2 promoter with two independently constructed full libraries (LDLR/LDLR.2):943 paired SNVs,284 strong-effect variants,244 weak/unresolved variants and415 intermediate variants. There are204 positive-control pairs matched by cell type, element and substitution class. Weak effects are not proven nulls. This one-promoter benchmark diagnoses a compatible pipeline; it cannot establish broad independent-element performance or Class B generalization. Its model performance and development-set independence remain untested.','', 'Five distinct technical probes were selected by a fixed seeded hash order before any inference. Each has a full-length reference and insertion-present allele in1Mb AlphaGenome and524288bp Borzoi contexts, with unchanged surrounding backbone and explicit distal compensation. Input sequence checks pass; native output support and reproducible prediction still require official model access. Homology intervals explicitly exclude ALT-only inserted sequence and REF-only distal context. No downstream equal-index bin subtraction is permitted.','', 'The declared full-native-window compatibility screen retains32,004/32,969 catalog loci and excludes965 before any model outcome. Core inference describes this compatible subset; excluded boundaries/lengths must not be called population performance. Prepared scripts implement guarded500-locus sampling and source-evidence-dependent exact allele matching. They have not generated a formal sample or external association result. The amendment fixes sign tests, uncertainty, covariate adjustment, OOD strata and nulls. No adjusted estimate, P value, significance, GO or regulatory atlas is inferred from preparation.','', 'Nature Genetics remains NG_PATH_CONDITIONAL. The computational GB/NC route can be reconsidered after actual dual-model QTL calibration; no journal route is validated yet. Lack of experimental ATAC is an explicit limitation, not an automatic Nature Genetics/project NO-GO.','', '**STOP: Phase2 not entered.**']
(R/'13_reports/PHASE1R2_FINAL_REPORT.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n');print(json.dumps(status),flush=True)
